**Worksheet**

F1: G object, rnd(G) mulberry32 used everywhere (no Math.random), endTurnPhaseA/B fixed order storm→prod→needs→arrivals→event→trade→finish. Score 2.

F2: 8x8 map (adjIdx %8), genMap uses rnd(G) for seed-derived terrain, build() checks d.ter.includes(t.ter), adjCount changes water/ash/ore/power/parts/scrip in prodOne. Score 2.

F3: ore→metal (forge), ash+water→soil (composter), soil+water→food (greenhouse); capOf + addRes clamp; G.overflow tracked/logged. Score 2.

F4: addColonist creates {skill,fatigue,morale,job,assign}; workMult(c,job) reads skill/fatigue/morale, used in prodOne. Score 2.

F5: needsPhase consumes food/water, shortage → morale d-=12/-15, workMult reads morale for output, gradual (not instant) change. Score 2.

F6: RDEF has 10 nodes, buyResearch enforces d.req + payCost; every node's effect read in prodOne/stormPhase/needsPhase/tradePhase (e.g. G.research.filtration, .kitchens, .bracing). Score 2.

F7: 12 EVENTS, weighted pick in eventPhase via w-field cumulative selection; 6 events (refugees, bloom, ventsurge, wanderer, illness, seedvault) have 2-3 differing choices; G.evCooldown[id]=8 set on fire. Score 2.

F8: unitPrice() reads G.res[g]/capOf and G.drift[g]; c.inv limited, decremented in doBuy/doSell; both wired to UI buttons. Score 2.

F9: stormPhase fires at G.nextStorm, sev grows with turn/15; prodOne returns 0 at dmg>=2, dmgMult 0.5 at dmg1; bracing/domes/stormwall reduce chance; tryRepair costs parts and clears dmg. Score 2.

F10: saveString/loadString round-trip via textarea; validateState checks shape and shows devSaveMsg err on bad input. Score 2.

F11: finishTurn sets G.ended 'lose' (pop 0) or 'win'/'fail' (turn60 criteria); score() combines pop/research/stock/turns/bonus; showEndModal renders summary. Score 2.

F12: renderTabs/curTab switching; log() stores {t:turn,m}; data-tip/showTip tooltips; keydown Space+digit shortcuts; @media(max-width:680px) layout. Score 2.

F13: runTestsCore asserts real invariants (no negative res, caps respected, roster consistency, prereqs enforced, save/load hash match); runBenchmarkCore runs 200 headless turns via doTurn/applyPolicy and prints hashState. Score 2.

G1: G.research.filtration/drilling/hydro/smelting/tooling read directly in prodOne's output formulas, applied every relevant turn. Score 4.

G2: needsPhase shortage → c.morale -= (12/15) → workMult(c,job) uses c.morale to gate/reduce output in prodOne. Full chain. Score 4.

G3: stormPhase sets t.b.dmg → prodOne checks dmg (0/0.5/disabled) → tryRepair spends parts and resets dmg=0. Full chain. Score 4.

G4: unitPrice() = BASE_PRICE × G.drift[g] (random-walked each tradePhase, plus 'rumor' event) × scarcity from G.res[g]/capOf. Score 4.

G5: refugees choices call addColonist/moraleAll; bloom/illness choices call addRes/fatigueSome/moraleAll directly on G state, not just log. Score 4.

